  "changelog": "Initial release of LiDAR Urban 3D Modeling skill.\n\n- Extracts building footprints, heights, and volumes from LiDAR point clouds using PMF ground filtering and nDSM calculation.\n- Supports both real (.npy/.csv/.txt) and synthetic point clouds for urban modeling.\n- Outputs building polygons (GeoJSON), normalized DSM (GeoTIFF), and detailed stats (JSON).\n- Includes example CLI commands for typical use cases, such as synthetic data, low-rise filtering, and real data input.\n- Runs entirely offline with local processing for privacy.",
